{"assets":["/statement-assets/f6bdf5c9f6d7303aaa29369842ef146e295333203fab4504d8ed6b620140deb6.png","/statement-assets/6976942e72313b745a006cf6589a5752e51ed03d2a693738863f6d644ad960f3.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"997","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Sky Full of Stars"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"On one of the planets of Solar system, in Atmosphere University, many students are fans of bingo game."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is well known that one month on this planet consists of $$$n^2$$$ days, so calendars, represented as square matrix $$$n$$$ by $$$n$$$ are extremely popular."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Weather conditions are even more unusual. Due to the unique composition of the atmosphere, when interacting with sunlight, every day sky takes one of three colors: blue, green or red."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To play the bingo, you need to observe the sky for one month — after each day, its cell is painted with the color of the sky in that day, that is, blue, green or red."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"At the end of the month, students examine the calendar. If at least one row or column contains only cells of one color, that month is called lucky."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's call two colorings of calendar different, if at least one cell has different colors in them. It is easy to see that there are $$$3^{n \\cdot n}$$$ different colorings. How much of them are lucky? Since this number can be quite large, print it modulo $$$998244353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first and only line of input contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 1000\\,000$$$) — the number of rows and columns in the calendar."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one number — number of lucky colorings of the calendar modulo $$$998244353$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"63\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"9933\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample any coloring is lucky, since the only column contains cells of only one color."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample, there are a lot of lucky colorings, in particular, the following colorings are lucky:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/f6bdf5c9f6d7303aaa29369842ef146e295333203fab4504d8ed6b620140deb6.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"While these colorings are not lucky:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/6976942e72313b745a006cf6589a5752e51ed03d2a693738863f6d644ad960f3.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"997C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/997/problem/C"}